00:00:08.447 --> 00:00:09.641
Clip number one is my personal favorite

00:00:09.641 --> 00:00:12.469
And at the end of the video
I share my thoughts as well.

00:00:12.469 --> 00:00:13.892
And as always, as you guys are watching,

00:00:13.892 --> 00:00:15.571
if you hear something that
really resonates with you,

00:00:15.571 --> 00:00:17.141
please leave it in the comments below,

00:00:17.141 --> 00:00:18.725
put quotes around it so other people

00:00:18.725 --> 00:00:20.022
